				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " an escape is ident content, so an escape-spelled name is still a function ",
				"start": 15,
				"end": 94
			},
			{
				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " the url recognizer decodes the name: quoted content takes the string path ",
